OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening to come with some late
OL,7,Fsunshine. A clear and dry night for
OL,8,Fall. Feeling rather cool or even
OL,9,Fchilly in rural spots.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA dry and bright morning.
OL,12,FHigh cloud at times will turn the
OL,13,Fsunshine hazy. Light winds will mean
OL,14,Fit'll feel hot to very hot in the
OL,15,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
